<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.7900 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.7900 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7900 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.7999 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     May 21		  May 20</p>
<p> High			     75.7999		 75.8000</p>
<p> Low				75.7520		 75.7700</p>
<p> Open			     75.7999		 75.7999</p>
<p> Close			    75.7900		 75.7999</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    0.705		   1.620</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
